# The storefront needs NO environment variables — the catalog comes from
# /api/catalog (Cloudflare KV, synced from the Google Sheet by the Worker).
#
# The two secrets that power the Sheet sync are Cloudflare Worker secrets,
# never .env values and never VITE_-prefixed (that would compile them into
# the public browser bundle):
#
#   npx wrangler secret put GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON   # full service-account JSON
#   npx wrangler secret put CATALOG_SHEET_ID              # id from the Sheet's URL
